                                    <TextRun>
                                      <Value>="The guarantors form must be signed by the new guarantor and witnessed by the withdrawing member and the loanee." &amp; vbCrLf &amp; vbCrLf &amp; "1) One copy to be retained by the member who is withdrawing the guarantee." &amp; vbCrLf &amp; "2) The second copy to be retained by the Society." &amp; IIf(Fields!IsClassB.Value, vbCrLf &amp; "3) The loanee MUST attach an ID copy for the new guarantor.", "")</Value>
